#: src/app/components/pages/settings/settings.rs:2112
msgid ""
"1. Open last.fm/api/account/create, create an API application, and copy the "
"API Key and Shared Secret into Canto."
msgstr ""
"1. Acesse last.fm/api/account/create, crie uma aplicação de API e copie a "
